<title>UK: Merrill Lynch sets warrants on Swissair.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets warrants on Swissair.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch Capital Markets AG says it has issued two million American-style call warrants, on Swissair.</p>
<p>20 warrants control one share.Z  STRIKE PRICE    1075.00 SFR	     PREMIUM	16.50 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     7.00 SFR		  GEARING	7.40 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 25.NOV.96-26.JUN.98   PAYDATE	20.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS SE		  MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  1043.00 SFR</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
